questions.question:
Pull request #812 changes the response schema of GET /v1/courses/{id}:

  level:
    type: string
-   enum: [beginner, intermediate, advanced]
+   enum: [beginner, intermediate, advanced, expert]

Android app 4.12 (in the store, installed by most Android learners) decodes the response with:

@Serializable enum class Level { @SerialName("beginner") BEGINNER, @SerialName("intermediate") INTERMEDIATE, @SerialName("advanced") ADVANCED }
@Serializable data class CourseDto(val id: String, val title: String, val level: Level)

Statement: "Adding expert is a non-breaking change for Android 4.12, because the pull request only adds an enum value and removes none."
